# Portal integrations (Encuentra24 leads + Compre o Alquile listings & contacts), every 5 minutes.
#
# Vercel Hobby only allows daily crons, so the Elevare DigitalOcean droplet
# pings the PropSync endpoint instead. No code runs here — it's just a curl.
# The endpoint loops over every agency that connected Encuentra24 or Compre o Alquile in
# Configuración → Fuentes (or in /panel-elevare): imports leads, publishes listings.
#
# Install on the droplet:
#   1. crontab -e
#   2. paste the line below, replacing <CRON_SECRET> with the same value set in
#      Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables → CRON_SECRET
#
*/5 * * * * curl -fsS -m 300 -H "Authorization: Bearer <CRON_SECRET>" https://www.propsyncia.com/api/cron/portales > /dev/null 2>&1
